   "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
  },
  {
   "article_number": 206,
   "bab": 8,
   "article_title_ar": "ممارسة الشريك أو المساهم مهنته الحرة",
   "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "a9c78465d3e755ac6bbb9eddce94896df3def61ee6e8a363b2c85d5080b4a117",
   "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "43bba45f727f7d229b4ce776280c0af2c6ed0f88dd6126aa08135c64397307c0",
   "prior_candidate_record_id": "zh-int-companies-art-206",
   "prior_candidate_hash_sha256": "d24a2c6dad1d4b0f6b1e8aaf60bfd57037357b8f7230c7296b4ba449ba1a296e",
   "qa_priority": "P1",
   "qa_recommended_action": "retranslate_from_arabic_before_full_chinese_layer",
   "remediated_chinese_text": "专业公司的合伙人或股东，除公司为一人所有外，只能通过公司执业其自由职业。\n作为本条第（一）款的例外，若其他合伙人以书面方式同意、或按情形取得股东大会的同意，合伙人或股东可以通过公司以外的途径执业其自由职业。\n若合伙人或股东违反本条第（一）款或第（二）款的规定，则其所取得的报酬和其他财务利益归公司享有。",
   "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "e15822bb00088b3d164fc902d940b21f3a368d68f1f6e059fe93b4e690c41b8e",
   "internal_reference_only": true,
   "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
   "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
   "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
   "source_basis": "official_source_based",
   "repository_legal_review_status": "repository_owner_review_active",
   "external_legal_review_status": "not_performed",
   "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
   "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
   "source_status_before": "isolable_candidate_materially_incomplete_or_condensed",
   "remediation_action": "retranslate_internal_chinese_from_arabic",
   "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
  },
  {
   "article_number": 207,
   "bab": 8,
   "article_title_ar": "إدارة الشركة",
   "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "e71d9e955adf8bcf6d24034d51555f23edcbea51577a6c0eff3b2a93aca28ce9",
   "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "356fc6a8e88d44e7cdd957c3e6cbb504a0b00454f8a651f81892671f523bc1d3",
   "prior_candidate_record_id": "zh-int-companies-art-207",
   "prior_candidate_hash_sha256": "2450bb4b1264e03f4d7c0a97489663daa2a18ae5092fd0067be4ed96af6f341e",
   "qa_priority": "P1",
   "qa_recommended_action": "retranslate_from_arabic_before_full_chinese_layer",
   "remediated_chinese_text": "在不影响本条第（二）款的前提下，专业公司的管理由其一名或多名合伙人或非合伙人担任；若由一人管理，则须为获准执业的合伙人；若由多人管理，则获准执业的合伙人人数不得少于实施条例所定人数。公司设立合同或其基本章程确定经理的任命条件、权限、报酬、管理公司的期限及其罢免方式。\n专业股份公司的管理由从其股东或非股东中组成的董事会担任。实施条例确定董事会成员中须为获准执业股东的人数。公司基本章程确定董事会的权限及有关其组成的规定。",
   "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "b64c1d339cbbcda903cecb7aa09d36fa6ee5e0bfc9fc2945f7b4c31c7f2b2db9",
   "internal_reference_only": true,
   "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
   "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
   "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
   "source_basis": "official_source_based",
   "repository_legal_review_status": "repository_owner_review_active",
   "external_legal_review_status": "not_performed",
   "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
   "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
   "source_status_before": "isolable_candidate_materially_incomplete_or_condensed",
   "remediation_action": "retranslate_internal_chinese_from_arabic",
   "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
  },
  {
   "article_number": 211,
   "bab": 8,
   "article_title_ar": "فقد ترخيص ممارسة المهنة الحرة",
   "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "ed2d831ab5691a0a0e7f0b13457a27a0d9e4c176e588ac660d91a2a643200c0e",
   "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "72d2a4eae36cbf68fb6f873c40717e328d7905de50023d363a77f19607d56184",
   "prior_candidate_record_id": "zh-int-companies-art-211",
   "prior_candidate_hash_sha256": "c0d61154964ea6ecc145970851a553b5ae86ca6c88be67ce6c4f016b26a7cb54",
   "qa_priority": "P1",
   "qa_recommended_action": "retranslate_from_arabic_before_full_chinese_layer",
   "remediated_chinese_text": "若专业公司的合伙人或股东暂时丧失其自由职业执业许可，则其应立即停止在公司中工作，直至恢复许可。若其为其他合伙人或股东中执业该职业的唯一从业者、或为专业公司的唯一所有人，则公司应停止执业该职业，直至恢复许可。就非一人所有的专业公司，公司设立合同或其基本章程说明在发生上述两种情形之一时其利润和亏损的分配方式。\n若专业公司的合伙人或股东永久丧失其自由职业执业许可，则其因此视为退出公司，但公司设立合同或其基本章程规定其作为不获准在公司执业职业的合伙人或股东继续留任的除外，条件是满足本法第（二百）条第（四）款所述条件、规则和准则。\n若专业公司的合伙人或股东永久丧失其自由职业执业许可、且其为合伙人或股东中执业该职业的唯一从业者，或专业公司为一人所有，或因专业公司合伙人或股东死亡或转让其份额或股份致使公司丧失其合伙人或股东中某一自由职业的唯一从业者；则公司应停止执业该职业，并在此情形下获得（六）个月的宽限期以按照本法规定纠正其状况。部长认为有利益时可以将此宽限期延长一个相同期限。公司在宽限期届满仍未纠正其状况的，即告消灭。",
   "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "cf594ef2cf4d447ce843aa9a6914ca20574a49490591629ebd8895c8d4c54ff9",
   "internal_reference_only": true,
   "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
   "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
   "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
   "source_basis": "official_source_based",
